{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/764927-musings-on-an-art-exigent","id":764927,"title":"Musings on an Art Exigent","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Exigents"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-13T07:50:02-08:00","id":764927,"title":"Musings on an Art Exigent","content":"I'm thinking about an art themed Exigent, specifically a Black Market Exigent whose patron is a forbidden goddess that once had dominion over art that could kill people or make them go insane. There's some obvious easy answers to what she can do based on corebook charms like putting Cup Boils Over into a painting or a Performance based version of Voice of the Night Bird etc but I was curious what ideas people had.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T07:57:56-08:00","id":764933,"title":"","content":"Is it all kinds of art or just painting/drawing? Would music that drives the listener insane be appropriate?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:02:55-08:00","id":764940,"title":"","content":"I'd give her a Charm that prevents her from aging because it is reflected into a portrait of her.<br /> If she makes a portrait she can share her senses with it.<br /> Trap people in paintings.<br /> Considering she's a Black Market Exigent, I'm gonna assume she's a lil' bit crazy, so possibly a Charm that lets her recover from injuries by literally painting over them.<br /> Turn your own blood into paint so you never run out of supplies.<br /> <br /> Clearly, If I made this Exigent, it'd be very Gothic Horror.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I made some Martial Arts for 3e, look at them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723442-survival-is-fury-the-monster-reborn-ex3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/632-while-my-guitar","name":"While My Guitar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:07:37-08:00","id":764945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/764927-musings-on-an-art-exigent?p=764933#post764933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it all kinds of art or just painting/drawing? Would music that drives the listener insane be appropriate?</div> </div> </div> </div>All forms of art, so yes. That would be appropriate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:08:57-08:00","id":764948,"title":"","content":"Hm.<br /> <br /> There's the ability to leave Inspire actions hanging in the ruins of structures and objects you've broken, or wounds you've left behind. Just because it's abstract doesn't mean it's not moving, after all.<br /> <br /> Charms that create silver XP out of decisive attacks.<br /> <br /> Charms that allow you to get away with surprising amounts of stuff just by making people interpret your rebellion as a rather large piece of performance art.<br /> <br /> Charms that beget obsession over beauty.<br /> <br /> Charms that make the wounds you inflict create madness in those who see them. Alternately, you could do this to wounds you receive.<br /> <br /> Some of these are pretty obvious, I'm sure, but just tossing out there first ideas to leap to mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:16:20-08:00","id":764953,"title":"","content":"...Make your art come to life as temporary servants.<br /> <br /> Make a piece of art so stunning that a person can literally not look away and will live and die in front of it.<br /> <br /> Become a piece of art, like a Stealth Charm where you become another pattern in the carpet.<br /> <br /> Create bursts of insane mania in other people after they... I'unno, tasted the Exigents blood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I made some Martial Arts for 3e, look at them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723442-survival-is-fury-the-monster-reborn-ex3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/632-while-my-guitar","name":"While My Guitar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:16:34-08:00","id":764954,"title":"","content":"Painting horrors that cause people to have nightmares about the image they saw.<br /> <br /> Painting monsters that co\u200bme alive and attack people.<br /> <br /> Music that causes you to bleed from the ears (less interesting than driving you insane, but I already said that).<br /> <br /> Turning people into statues/art.<br /> <br /> Creating statues that come to life, but due to the nature of the Goddess who powered the Exigence, they're insane.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:26:59-08:00","id":764965,"title":"","content":"A charm that lets you hide messages in your work that's only visible to people with particular derangements.<br /> <br /> A stealth charm not unlike Atrocity Without Witness: You've made yourself so garish, so terrible, that people ignore your presence rather than confront the nightmarish possibility that you're there.<br /> <br /> Convincing somebody to fill a role so well that the whole world sees them as that despite all evidence to the contrary.<br /> <br /> Is there anything else we should know about the goddess? I know Holden's mentioned that the deity may well color the Exigence in ways outside their domain.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:30:48-08:00","id":764971,"title":"","content":"How about an Integrity Charm that refreshes your Willpower when interacting with the mentally-ill?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:33:56-08:00","id":764975,"title":"","content":"You should check out the Deceived sourcebook for Mummy the Curse. Great inspiration for forbidden gods of art there (all the tamukh are basically that, each expressing in a different medium).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:37:19-08:00","id":764982,"title":"","content":"Just notions really:<br /> <br /> - Black Swan / Perfect Blue style stuff in which a person is focusing on acting or art and loses their sense of reality into the role.<br /> - Creating an obsession towards the character in another.<br /> - Turn familiars into maddened (and madly strong) beasts.<br /> - I'd imagine that an Exalted like this would have affinity with relating to and understanding or bartering with the creatures of the Wyld, particularly, yet also and underworld, and certain beings of hell. Many of these creatures are themselves, or are of, mad art.<br /> - There's the obvious &quot;Drawing from the essence of unspeakable texts... my movements so crazy!&quot; combat Charms that make you hard to fight against.<br /> - You could have this character drawing up the essence of insanity from deranging art unto herself, cleansing it. (Depends on whether that is really within purview though).<br /> - Create art which is subversive specifically, and breaks people out of narrow thought patterns and constraints. More liberating than destructive.<br /> <br /> Tough. The ideas that spring to my mind are more generic to madness and sanity than specific to mad art.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T08:52:58-08:00","id":764994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/764927-musings-on-an-art-exigent?p=764965#post764965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there anything else we should know about the goddess?</div> </div> </div> </div>Her name is Lan-Darha, The Heartrending Grace.<br /> She occasionally responds to the prayers of artists who\u2019ve had their talents exploited.<br /> She used to be so beautiful that it scarred people\u2019s souls to look at her, a trait that\u2019s been lost since creating the Exaltation but even in her diminished state I imagine her as benefiting from some both worlds state with the Hideous merit.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T09:06:28-08:00","id":765000,"title":"","content":"- Art that inspires intense feelings of greed and envy the more people look at it. <br /> - Alien landscapes that can turn whoever looks at them into demons/undead/Fair Folk, banishing them from Creation. <br /> - Art that transfers the artist's intimacies to someone else, so any social influence directed at the artist that's based on these intimacies hits the &quot;someone else&quot; instead. <br /> - Art that promotes idolatry (and as a result, human sacrifices to the artist).<br /> - Art that passes skills on to people who adhere to a specific principle. The strength of the principle determines how much people can learn.<br /> - Fractal art pattern that prevents whoever sees it from sleeping until they succeed at an extended Intelligence + Investigation roll to understand it properly. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T10:36:42-08:00","id":765033,"title":"","content":"Any Art? Or just the fine arts? Is dance an art? are martial arts killing arts? what about art which kills the artist or which engenders obsession and the destruction of the mind (something like Black Swan if you've seen it).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2116-jivex","name":"JiveX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2116_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T12:33:23-08:00","id":765090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JiveX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/764927-musings-on-an-art-exigent?p=765033#post765033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any Art? Or just the fine arts?</div> </div> </div> </div>More fine arts, though I think putting a wall between fine/applied seems unnatural.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JiveX</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Is dance an art? are martial arts killing arts?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dance is considered a fine art, killing arts lends itself more towards applied art.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JiveX</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">what about art which kills the artist or which engenders obsession and the destruction of the mind (something like Black Swan if you've seen it).</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds viable and yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T16:46:47-08:00","id":765219,"title":"","content":"\u2022&quot;Basilisk Fractal&quot; style art that cripples those who look at it. <br /> <br /> \u2022Creating your own psychosis-sanctum that you can manipulate on the fly using your art skills.<br /> <br /> \u2022Art that warps people's memories and perceptions through targeted delusions and hallucinations.<br /> <br /> \u2022Art that turns the insane but normal into the sane but mutated, and vice-versa.<br /> <br /> \u2022A charm which rides off another art charm and compels everyone who sees it to attempt to copy it as best they are able, with the better made ones replicating all the original enchantments.<br /> <br /> \u2022Art that sucks heath levels from those in its presence, and which may transfer the stolen levels to its maker with a touch.<br /> <br /> \u2022Art that temporarily inverts the intimacies of its audience, compelling them to act against all they love and aid everyone they hate.<br /> <br /> \u2022Art that can control hungry ghosts, making them love/obey the user.<br /> <br /> \u2022Art that destroys the basic coherency of Raksha and other Wyld Things, killing or mutilating them.<br /> <br /> \u2022Art that opens gateways between worlds, allowing demons and ghosts and fey to walk through the cracks. <br /> <br /> Hope that helps!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-13T16:56:34-08:00","id":765226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/764927-musings-on-an-art-exigent?p=764994#post764994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Her name is Lan-Darha, The Heartrending Grace.<br /> She occasionally responds to the prayers of artists who\u2019ve had their talents exploited.<br /> She used to be so beautiful that it scarred people\u2019s souls to look at her, a trait that\u2019s been lost since creating the Exaltation but even in her diminished state I imagine her as benefiting from some both worlds state with the Hideous merit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tell us more about the goddess. What does she look like, exactly? What garb and appurtenances form her panoply? What other notable powers does she possess?<br /> <br /> How would you describe her personality? What dramatic events has she precipitated or taken part in? What reputation accrues to her for her deeds?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-14T08:11:11-08:00","id":765563,"title":"","content":"Lan-Darha's still taking shape in my mind.<br /> <br /> Currently my mental image of her resembles common depictions of Hel with her left side giving way to something that's invariably creepy yet undeniably creative that probably changes from appearance to appearance. So maybe one time she has exposed bone that's been lovingly carved with poetry only to later replace it with a golden wire sculpture of exposed musculature.<br /> <br /> Personality wise she seems to be shaping up as something of a dark muse who\u2019ll instigate terrible things by telling the wrong people that their goals are just within their reach. I don\u2019t think she considers madness as inherently different from any other kind of suffering an artist might undergo for the sake of pursuing their craft.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s also worth noting that she sees value in all art hence why she\u2019s willing to aid exploited artists and I could easily envision see her seeking retribution upon Immaculate Monks for destroying a graven image.<br /> <br /> Finally, I\u2019m trying to resist drawing obvious connections to Translucent Alabaster of RoGD1 besides the fact that they\u2019re both art goddesses who may or may not be aware that the other exists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":7,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","user":"Lioness","date":". 11-14-2015, 11:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-15T00:13:50-08:00","id":766113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/764927-musings-on-an-art-exigent?p=765563#post765563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personality wise she seems to be shaping up as something of a dark muse who\u2019ll instigate terrible things by telling the wrong people that their goals are just within their reach. I don\u2019t think she considers madness as inherently different from any other kind of suffering an artist might undergo for the sake of pursuing their craft.</div> </div> </div> </div>This strikes me as pretty important. Given that the Flaws system tells us to treat Derangements as Intimacies for the purposes of social influence, there's some mechanics hidden in there allowing her chosen to gain appropriately-valued bonuses to certain rolls as along as they're playing to their own beautifully fragmented psyche. I can also see some sort of charm that allows them to reverse wound penalties for social influence purposes, as they are clearly suffering for the sake of their art.<br /> <br /> I honestly think there should absolutely be something like Genius Palate Summation in there, too, allowing the Exigent to read the feelings that went into the creation of a piece of art, or perhaps broadening that a bit, so they could see the spurned hatred in the abstract blood-spatter of a man murdered by his ex-lover.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}